    "text": "IT is hereby notified that Hon. Eranjan Naveen Dissanayaka, MP, who was appointed to the office of Minister of PublicManagement Reforms by His Excellency the President, in the exercise of powers vested in him, by Article 44(1)(b) of theConstitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, has in terms of Article 47(b) of the Constitution, resigned suchoffice of Minister, with effect from November 29, 2014.",
